WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.620
Hello English learners from all over the world.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:11.440
Chad here with another very cool English lesson
based on a really funny scene from Friends,

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.720
one of the best TV shows for learning English.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:21.300
So to really make the most out of this learning
experience, download the Power Lesson.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:27.050
There you are going to see that we break down
and explain all the most important vocabulary,

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:33.350
expressions, slang, also the pronunciation,
all the connected speech, and the cultural

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.550
references.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.330
The stuff that doesn't translate very well.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:42.180
So this is a really funny scene it's based
on Thanksgiving.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:51.640
You may see Joey Tribianni eat a whole turkey
too, so sit back, relax, prepare yourself

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.640
for this learning experience, and enjoy

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.200
this scene from Friends.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.720
Aww yeah!!

